  "query": "-- Every skill under its area, in order.\nSELECT\n    skill_areas.name AS area,\n    skills.name,\n    skills.level\nFROM skills\nINNER JOIN skill_areas ON skills.area_id = skill_areas.id\nORDER BY skill_areas.sort, skill_areas.name, skills.sort, skills.name\n",
